## 🔐 Best Practices

### 1. Respect Rate Limits
- Add delays between requests
- Don't fetch too frequently
- Some sites limit requests

### 2. Error Handling
- Always use try/except
- Don't crash if one source fails
- Log errors for debugging

### 3. Source Reliability
- Prioritize official sources (BBC, ESPN)
- Be cautious with blogs/forums
- Verify social media claims

### 4. Update Regularly
- RSS feeds can change
- Websites redesign (breaks scraping)
- Check sources monthly

